<article class="env-lemma" id="0D8L">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0D8L">Lemma <span data-tag="0D8L">85.19.2</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{C}$ be a site with fibre product and $X \in \mathop{\mathrm{Ob}}\nolimits (\mathcal{C})$. Let $K$ be a hypercovering of $X$. For $E \in D(\mathcal{C}/X)$ the map </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  E \longrightarrow Ra_*a^{-1}E  \]
</div>
  <p> is an isomorphism. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Via Remarks <a href="/tag/0D89" data-tag="0D89">85.15.5</a> and <a href="/tag/0D8C" data-tag="0D8C">85.16.4</a> and the discussion in the introduction to this section this follows from Lemma <a href="/tag/0D8G" data-tag="0D8G">85.17.3</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>